    {
      "id": "northstar_settlement",
      "duration": "45s",
      "layout": {"type": "center", "gap": "large", "align": "center"},
      "auto_visible": false,
      "show_progress_bar": false,
      "narration": "Next, the Northstar trade record reaches the prime broker. The prime broker checks that the details match and that the trade fits the limits already agreed for this account. If the trade is accepted, the prime broker coordinates and records what happens next. Now the trade settles. Through market infrastructure, the fund's cash moves out and 100 Northstar shares move in. Only now does the account show a completed position: plus 100 Northstar. Northstar did not appear from nowhere. It is the same purchase we have followed the entire time.",
