      "auto_visible": false,
      "show_progress_bar": false,
      "narration": "Prime brokerage is not a smarter version of an ordinary broker. It is the central operating and financing relationship behind an institutional fund's trading. The fund chooses the investments. Executing brokers make the trades. Market infrastructure completes the exchange. Stock lending supports borrowed shares. And the prime broker accepts eligible trades into the relationship, carries the positions, provides agreed financing and reporting, and monitors collateral. Several trading doors. One place to operate the accepted positions. That is the problem prime brokerage solves.",
